From: Xun2202 <98207886+Xun2202@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 16:38:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] download: recover repeated HLS segment denial with a source
 rendition

The device log shows the complete-cache TS path applies, while a different 1080p transfer keeps failing at segment 169 after re-resolution. Revalidate the proxy once and, if the same segment is still forbidden, try the highest eligible lower variant exposed by the same source. Keep variant caches isolated and require a complete save.
